{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the mythological world of ancient Egypt in Horus: Desert Survivor, a thrilling blend of survivor-like action and deckbuilding strategy. Take on the role of Horus, battling corrupted gods, mythical beasts, and endless hordes as you seek vengeance and restore balance to your fathers land.<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952340/extras/51ae24f3d56f10921a05777d38688d3b.poster.avif?t=1756058748\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952340/extras/51ae24f3d56f10921a05777d38688d3b.webm?t=1756058748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952340/extras/51ae24f3d56f10921a05777d38688d3b.mp4?t=1756058748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Face relentless waves of enemies, from corrupted deities to mythical creatures. Master your combat skills and unleash divine powers to cleanse the fallen and turn the tide in your favor. Adapt to each challenge as the hordes grow stronger with every encounter.<br> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952340/extras/818467e8af946174fe2c59f84fd93dda.poster.avif?t=1756058748\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952340/extras/818467e8af946174fe2c59f84fd93dda.webm?t=1756058748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952340/extras/818467e8af946174fe2c59f84fd93dda.mp4?t=1756058748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Build your arsenal of magical weapons through strategic deckbuilding. Combine divine artifacts, ancient weapons and training to create synergies that give you the edge in battle. Every choice shapes your journey and strengthens your ability to survive. <br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952340/extras/c7833be78881871901d4413762e2a767.poster.avif?t=1756058748\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952340/extras/c7833be78881871901d4413762e2a767.webm?t=1756058748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952340/extras/c7833be78881871901d4413762e2a767.mp4?t=1756058748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Forge your destiny as you navigate through ancient temples, cursed lands, and the unforgiving desert. Make impactful choices that define your playstyle, unlock new powers, and determine your ultimate fate. Will you succumb to the corruption or rise above it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  In this demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will travel through the first map of the game, out of 3 in the final game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against 2 end game bosses (6 in final game), 3 mini bosses (9 in final game) and 7 different enemies (10+ in final game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use over 50+ (120+ in final game) cards, 10 unique weapons (15+ in final game)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952340?t=1756058748","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952340?t=1756058748","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952340/4b9ceb52f75575265e2f4358343f47ee9e916a35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756058748","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952340/4b9ceb52f75575265e2f4358343f47ee9e916a35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756058748","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the mythological world of ancient Egypt in Horus: Desert Survivor, a thrilling blend of survivor-like action and deckbuilding strategy. Take on the role of Horus, battling corrupted gods, mythical beasts, and endless hordes as you seek vengeance and restore balance to your fathers land.<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952340/extras/51ae24f3d56f10921a05777d38688d3b.poster.avif?t=1756058748\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952340/extras/51ae24f3d56f10921a05777d38688d3b.webm?t=1756058748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952340/extras/51ae24f3d56f10921a05777d38688d3b.mp4?t=1756058748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Face relentless waves of enemies, from corrupted deities to mythical creatures. Master your combat skills and unleash divine powers to cleanse the fallen and turn the tide in your favor. Adapt to each challenge as the hordes grow stronger with every encounter.<br> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952340/extras/818467e8af946174fe2c59f84fd93dda.poster.avif?t=1756058748\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952340/extras/818467e8af946174fe2c59f84fd93dda.webm?t=175605